# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001020> (exposure to herbal medicine preparation)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001020> "An exposure to a preparation of one or more herbal or other natural materials used as a traditional medicine, such as a decoction, pill, powder or granule formulation.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001020> <https://ai4curation.github.io/aidocs/reference/clients/claude-code/>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001020> "Grouping class for named traditional-medicine formulations (e.g. TCM decoctions, Kampo formulas) extracted from study metadata; individual formulas are asserted as children.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001020> "exposure to herbal medicine preparation")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0001020> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECTO_0000509>)


